The wiki article at http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Crysknife is correct in its
description:

"...if it leaves your possession, it reverts back into a worm tooth (when
fixed, this only happens 10% of the time). It can safely be put in a
container without reverting, as long as that container remains in your
possession."

Putting it in a container that you hold is safe.  If the container leaves
your possession, then it will revert (unless it's fixed, then 90% of the
time it will not.)  The magic happens in obj_no_longer_held(), which gets
recursively called for all items within a container.

I actually had no idea that fixed crysknives had a chance of reverting -- I
don't think I've ever made one before.

